                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So let me tell you about the creator of these games, Jeff Vogel. He has a blog where he wrote an article about AI. I released a small and non insulting response and he responded by blocking me for a year, calling me a kid when I'm older than him, and insulting my mother and yes I'm serious. Then when I went back on my other account he hid my responses because he's too much of a coward to have an actual conversation. He thinks he says what he says matters and that's the end of the story. That aside, his games are garbage. In 2026 they aren't as good as the superior work he tries to copy from the late 80's and early 90's. The only people there's an audience for this are people from that era that are just spinning their tires and can't handle change. These \"games\" can't hold a candle to things like Utlima 5 and Ultima 6 which came out in 88 and 90 and in some ways still are the bar that other rpg's aspire to. He's a petty man that's riding the coat tails of greater men that did it first and his only appeal is nostalgia goggles. As you can tell from hours played I've given this a fair shot and it's as lame as it's creator is cowardly. Avoid at all costs.",
